# CR 118.4/601.2h: a hybrid Phyrexian shard ({B/G/P}) paid with its first
# colour -- ChoosePayHybridPhyrexian answering a nonzero mana.Colors instead
# of the zero one mana-payment-hybrid-phyrexian-life's own "life" answer
# means -- spends black mana, no life.
# Main phase of turn 1, so the payment is made at a priority (L2 S19); the
# lands are tapped there, since a pool loaded by setup.state empties as the
# steps pass (CR 500.4).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 B
queue payhybridphyrexian B
paymanacost human B/G/P
